## 🔄 If You Need to Change Projects

If you want separate Supabase projects for gurudevi-mobile and edlove-web later:

1. Create a new Supabase project
2. Get the new credentials
3. Update the corresponding [.env](file:///c:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/edlove-web/.env) file
4. Restart the development server

